<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5955] Ignite Continuous Query (Queries 3): IgniteCacheContinuousQueryClientReconnectTest fails</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5955</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reproducible locally with the same exception as on TC.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In test log there is the following exception:&lt;/p&gt;
