&lt;p&gt;According to &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?tab=testDetails&amp;amp;branch_Ignite20Tests=%3Cdefault%3E&amp;amp;projectId=Ignite20Tests&amp;amp;testNameId=9004507841514895830&amp;amp;page=5&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TC history&lt;/a&gt; is failing since mid of April.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Last commit where test has been passing is &lt;b&gt;b6b3d3754849&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
